+# MP4 player source provenance
+
+The player sources in this directory were restored from the official
+`kendryte/k230_sdk` repository at commit
+`8074e1e1adde7587d36eca6745342c14f1dcd8fb` (SDK v1.6 lineage):
+
+- `src/big/mpp/middleware/src/mp4_player/`
+
+They are redistributed under the accompanying BSD 2-Clause `LICENSE`.
+That license covers every file in this directory, including `Makefile`,
+`kplayer.c`, and `player_res.c`, whose historical copies did not repeat the
+license header inline.
+Local changes add EdgeOS playback lifecycle handling, display-resource reuse,
+and seeking through the current FFmpeg-backed `mp4_format` API. The library is
+always built from these sources; this directory contains no precompiled
+archive.
